Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.15,0:00:07.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:19.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:23.74,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:27.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:34.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:41.32,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:49.36,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:55.59,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:59.37,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.38,0:01:04.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.35,0:01:10.42,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.49,0:01:22.27,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.79,0:22:18.29,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们 在生命的旅程中{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.86,0:22:24.37,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渐渐地 失去所有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:30.18,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我仍坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.81,0:22:37.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.19,0:22:47.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今在那深深的丛林中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.69,0:22:53.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也一定埋藏着 被丢弃的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.53,0:22:59.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若能把握时光的轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.70,0:23:06.21,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许 能再次飞翔{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.35,0:23:14.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将彷徨着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.15,0:23:21.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生存下去 直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.22,0:23:26.60,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍然坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.03,0:23:33.60,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:01:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 帮我拿酱油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来伸出手不就拿到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.55,0:02:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我就不用酱油了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这紧张兮兮的气氛是怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷不知道你在那边发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.77,0:02:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过难得大家一起吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能开心一点嘛 怎么样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 好冷哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:25.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吃饱了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:33.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子她妈 她到底是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着担心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:36.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看 茶叶梗立起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远隔万里而相通的二人之心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像已经好久没有来学校了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由加 绘理 步美 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你怎么还这么悠闲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大事不好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你得了economy class症候群请假的时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs23}economy class症候群：实际上不存在这种疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么乱七八糟的症候群啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷又学会新的病名了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.47,0:03:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条学长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女孩是一年级的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.81,0:03:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这段时间总是缠着北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学好像也不是很讨厌她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办？戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么怎么办？这不是好事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放着不管可是会被抢走的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方才一年级
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮肤又这么光滑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是北条同学那样的男生最喜欢的类型哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:53.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我又没在跟北条同学交往
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:59.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然另外有男朋友对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:01.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.27,0:04:04.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可能会表现得这么平静
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是谁嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:09.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从实招来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样啦 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我光是想起他就一肚子火
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:17.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:20.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快要上课了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:21.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要快点了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:28.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是烦死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在怀疑我什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你刚才一直是那样看我的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要冲我发脾气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为是你自己有那种奇怪的误会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烦死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想看到你这张脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你去哪好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.43,0:04:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去钢牙那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:02.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么看都只是一口古井而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里跟戈薇的国家连在一起的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是能通过古井的只有戈薇和犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明只有犬夜叉能去接戈薇回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只没大脑的笨狗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却不知道在赌什么气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是拿他没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有人在背后说我坏话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.47,0:05:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 有人说你坏话也不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你的确干了那么多蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.21,0:05:44.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 老太婆 你说我做了什么蠢事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋就是笨蛋 无可救药了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要找出四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:54.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇的灵力是不可少的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却搞不清楚状况
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:05:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还把她给气回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少啰唆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是她自己擅自跑回去的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还说什么“我要回家了 笨蛋”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你学戈薇一点都不像
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种事情有什么所谓嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 请大家排好队
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 姑娘的手相不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以后会很长寿而且子孙满堂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人 是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意为我生个孩子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:37.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人你好讨厌哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人刚才也跟我说了一样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.47,0:06:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要看到美女
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:44.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就忍不住想要对方为我生孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 这么看来似乎有点苗头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是不知道我能不能一次满足你们二位呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.98,0:06:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人好讨厌哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是老头子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们现在怎么急也没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非犬夜叉能够好好冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们几个根本是无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉笨得无可救药了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:15.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上他的脾气又臭又硬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.07,0:07:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看是没希望了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后最好不要靠近枯井
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:22.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想想犬夜叉的性格
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:27.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是发现有人在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:30.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算他想去接戈薇小姐也去不了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:32.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那家伙与表面相反
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内心也有很可爱的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.03,0:07:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人不可貌相啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们眼前就有个最好的例子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 没人在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇那家伙 我还是无法原谅她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对 要让她道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:01.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 这次你逃不掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:02.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在跟什么样的男生交往啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个小气的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,野蛮任性又暴躁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还是个超～级醋坛子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是如果爱吃醋的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就表示他很喜欢戈薇吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:20.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 原来很顺利嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为会更有趣点呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样不是很好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人对戈薇很专情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是这样的话我也没话说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙没办法忘记以前喜欢过的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都犹豫不决呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:37.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛 仔细想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉明明是喜欢桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要因为我吃醋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇受到了很猛烈的追求对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人还想杀了接近我的男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到底是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你为什么要跟那种人交往呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须跟他分手 绝对不能再见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可…可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是野蛮又任性吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还脚踏两条船
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然说如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可 可是他也有优点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人很温柔 而且很强大很可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.32,0:09:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是喜欢他吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢…？我喜欢犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇一定是喜欢他的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 她不在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里…充满了戈薇的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.01,0:10:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是戈薇姐姐的弟弟 叫草太
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是来玩的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:10.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.51,0:10:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你们没有吵架啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为姐姐看上去心情很不好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还在生气啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个女人真爱计较
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 怎么突然觉得好累…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.81,0:10:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 狗狗哥哥他…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.28,0:10:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不要告诉戈薇我到这来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是男人之间的约定哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人之间的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:51.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:58.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么随便进别人的房间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…那个…这是男人之间的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过仔细想想
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时犬夜叉这么辛苦跑来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我却站在钢牙那一边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:26.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然…是我不对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:31.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会向她道歉的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.07,0:11:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙到底去干什么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个让人操心的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你自己说不准我们靠近枯井的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.72,0:11:55.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事情就是要观看过程才好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:03.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到学校里来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,病已经好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:12.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们最近都没时间好好谈话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真伤脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这周的周末
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得应该回去比较好的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你周六没空吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会去吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说她想去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.02,0:12:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.59,0:12:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 周六见吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:35.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你们干嘛擅自帮我决定嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像北条同学这样正常的男人才适合戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续跟那个醋坛子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又花心 还有暴力倾向的男生交往下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇的将来会很悲惨的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是在说犬夜叉吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了 你一定要去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉还在生气吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他本来就很顽固的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想看到你那张脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.81,0:13:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啊…现在回去的话可能又要吵架了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为姐姐看上去心情很不好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:44.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂…不要突然冒出来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.97,0:13:50.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你赶紧去接她回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇会原谅你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那岂不是好像是我错了一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来就是你不对！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:14:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在怀疑戈薇是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:05.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还说要决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是那种时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙受伤了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇确实保护了钢牙让他逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明知道钢牙是犬夜叉的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且戈薇还不计较自己被他劫持并遇到危险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:25.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 明明最受钢牙欺负的是戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么她还要帮钢牙啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇说不定真的喜欢上了钢牙对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要问我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要劝人家的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:39.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先想好一套说词再来行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在给我滚吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.19,0:14:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 犬夜叉 刚才是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:57.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:00.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烦死人了 你真的是很烦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过不去接她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就绝对不会去接她！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 你先听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这种麻烦的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.58,0:15:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找人生经验丰富的枫姥姥商量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.21,0:15:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是最好的办法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用担心 我不会说出你的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就假装是要问我朋友的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是可以稍微听你一次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 只…只是稍微哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实呢 我是帮我一个狗狗朋友来找你商量的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不是我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.98,0:15:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说 你那个狗朋友怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个狗狗啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢上一只猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了一匹野狼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:59.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且对猫咪一见钟情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗狗与野狼每次见面都会打架
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,野狼 从狗狗身边抢走了猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是仇恨野狼的妖怪出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,野狼受了重伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.27,0:16:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后赶来救猫咪的狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使消灭了妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗狗想把受伤的野狼也一并收拾掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫咪却保护了野狼 让他逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫咪只是保护了受伤的野狼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.69,0:16:33.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗狗却怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫咪是不是喜欢上那只野狼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.03,0:16:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后猫咪就生气地回到了自己的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 事情大概就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要让狗狗和猫咪和好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么做才好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先狗要承认自己错了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:54.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:56.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你激动什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是在说七宝的狗朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:03.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你继续说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想 猫咪可能等狗狗去接她等得都不耐烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这两个人都误会了对方所以无法和好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先要让两个人见面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再好好谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这应该是解决问题最快捷的方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 你还要在这边待多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 我不能在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在学业繁忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.43,0:17:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能总是跑去战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就总是跑去那边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为犬夜叉会来带我回去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能已经不会来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么会知道那种事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.55,0:17:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是姐姐一直在生气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.55,0:18:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他才不来的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我一直在生气…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:17.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天一早再起来念书吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在根本集中不了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.07,0:18:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被子好舒服…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边根本就睡不舒服啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.61,0:18:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实也不会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉会替我值夜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在…他在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 睡着了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.93,0:18:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:19:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦话？她梦到我了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.01,0:19:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这臭丫头到底在做什么梦啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:15.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我记住！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闹钟不见了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.73,0:19:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…是犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来过了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:38.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,急事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以周六不能陪你去看电影了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:44.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.82,0:19:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…还有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别介意我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那个一年级的女孩子去看电影吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为…那孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是挺喜欢北条同学的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真傻 原来你是在意那种事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不打算跟别的女生交往
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.21,0:20:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.27,0:20:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我有点高兴呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮原来因为我在吃醋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我下次再约你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.18,0:20:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:19.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学真坚强…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.19,0:20:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也能像那样自信满满的就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈…戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.93,0:20:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正犬夜叉不会道歉的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我稍微向他低头
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就能和好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.68,0:20:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.81,0:20:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那是什么表情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在生气对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:54.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好高兴哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.36,0:20:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到犬夜叉会这么老实地向我道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.89,0:21:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 真的不生气？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 你说是你不好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是因为你弄坏了这个闹钟？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:08.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你以为还有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.64,0:21:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.11,0:21:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你们搞什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.25,0:21:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉其实是在反省的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还去了你那边两次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:26.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从戈薇走了以后 他就一直在叹气…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.15,0:21:27.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去了两次？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.09,0:21:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你们不要多嘴啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么知道我去那边了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.89,0:21:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 既然已经回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就先老实道歉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少啰唆！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我们吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.11,0:21:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不干呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是担心你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.31,0:21:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁要你们多管闲事！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.65,0:21:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是在担心你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:55.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我必须要道歉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:56.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就原谅他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:22:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真激动啊 因为他高兴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.89,0:22:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为戈薇回来了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不是我的错！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样…风穴！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有本事就吸我进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.16,0:23:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到有风
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.63,0:23:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥漫着妖气的风
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.07,0:23:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风突然成为利刃 将一切撕碎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.27,0:23:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在奈落的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.21,0:23:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们发现了妖狼族的残骸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.81,0:24:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族重新站起来 袭向犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.18,0:24:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快住手 钢牙 这是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死了你的同伴的不是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.09,0:24:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:13.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被设计的死斗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.19,0:24:14.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.53,0:24:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.03,0:25:22.02,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯真的少年 对戈薇一往情深{\pos(316,289)}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.03,0:25:22.02,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送给她各种健康产品{\pos(288,414)}
